{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新年结束后的新学期。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明还不到半年，却觉得已经当这里的学生很久了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，学园合并的事情怎么样了？”", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像有各种说法喔。不过，还算顺利吧。”", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1765", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“毕竟是那个濑名学园长大人主导的。”", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1766", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“隼太也认可那个人吗？”", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……至少我知道她不是只会嘴巴说说的人。”", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1767", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“比起那个，你在那之后怎么样了？顺利吗？”", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1768", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，托福托福。”", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我看了一眼在远处跟其他女生说话的纱凪，然后回答隼太的问题。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在那之后，我跟她的关系发展得很顺利。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟她在一起真的很快乐。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是这段关系，我们还没有对全部的人坦白。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“怎么了，表情不太高兴喔？”", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1769", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就算幸福也是有烦恼的啊。”", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 338, "voice": "_ht1770", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不知道该不该说是烦恼，嗯。我跟她的确进展得很好。”", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，我觉得还没有成为真正意义上的恋人。”", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经没多少时间了。", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐很快就要从结女毕业。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "必须好好跟她说才行。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟纱凪的事。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而这需要她下定决心。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……说的也是。结果，还没跟美羽学姐说就过年了……”", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4605", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你还不想说出来吗？”", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4606", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是，我最近一定会跟美羽学姐报告。”", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4607", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊。”", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然她有这个想法，那我就不需要再多说什么了。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，进社团教室前……”", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4608", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪拉住我的袖子。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在这里？”", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……去那边的阴影处。”", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4609", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使是过年后的第三学期，纱凪想跟我接吻的欲望依然没有变。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次双唇相贴，就能感觉到彼此的爱意。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对于不好意思把感情说出口的纱凪，接吻这个行为让她很高兴的样子。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以她索吻的方式也越来越厉害了。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我好像变成亲吻魔了……彻底迷上……这样好吗？”", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6852", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“与其说亲吻魔，应该是索吻魔吧？而且最近纱凪也很少主动亲我。”", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“因、因为身高差太多，平常想主动亲你很难嘛！”", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6853", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以接吻还是我主动。而纱凪是接受，或者说引诱的那方比较多。", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6854", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她每次对我索吻都会像这样静静地等着我。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她害羞与期待交织的表情，对我来说实在是可爱到受不了……", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……啾。”", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……只有、脸颊……？”", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6855", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "忍不住捉弄她一下。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到她一瞬间落寞的表情，又让我心动不已。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只有脸颊不够吗？”", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“没、没有啊……啊、嗯！”", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6856", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然地吻上还在逞强的她。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……唔、嗯……”", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6857", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然是后园的阴影处，但毕竟是校内。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以真的只是唇瓣相贴的吻。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为轻巧，所以意识反而集中在嘴唇上。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "任何一点动静都让纱凪浑身紧绷。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……啊、新吾……”", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6858", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，没事的。”", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我揽住她的腰，撑着双腿发软的纱凪。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从几天前开始就是这样。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "每次嘴唇彼此确认爱意，她总是很快就腿软到站不住。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "接吻对纱凪来说就是如此特别的行为。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……能走吗？”", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“再、再维持这样一下……”", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6859", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……”", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我把靠在我身上的纱凪抱得更紧。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯嗯。”", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6860", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪也把软绵绵的手臂绕到我的脖子上，全身都贴着我。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们在阴影下拥抱。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "sn6861", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她细微的呼吸声、体温、触感、重量、嘴唇上残留的余韵，全部我都好喜欢……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果接吻就这样了，那“接下来”的事情可不能随随便便。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算破瓜的伤已经痊愈也一样。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，能回应她的索求也让我有深深的满足感。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“辛苦了。”", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咦，怎么了？大家都在……”", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4618", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一进入社团教室，就看到大家围着美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“发生什么问题了吗？”", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，不是的。与其说问题，应该说有点在意……”", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_mu3325", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“在意？”", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“天羽学姐好像看到了身体比较大的熊喵。”", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "_ar6601", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“身体比较大，不是我们的熊喵？”", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～？”", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 323, "voice": "_pn0628", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且还看到它带着小孩。”", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "_sk5382", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“也就是说，这附近住着熊喵小姐一族……”", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 295, "voice": "_ag3983", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“熊喵一族……？”", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4619", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟纱凪对视了一眼。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小熊喵也是在去年的年底左右，我听到它好像在叫着谁。”", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_mu3326", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大概是本能吧。知道自己的同伴就在附近……”", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "_ar6602", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“如果是熊喵小姐一族的话，能想办法让它们见面吗？”", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 295, "voice": "_ag3984", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_mu3327", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽学姐非常在意的样子。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以她看起来才会有点疲倦的感觉吗？", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“总之，我们需要多一点情报。”", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 315, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……美羽学姐，你还好吗？”", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "_sn4620", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，嗯，抱歉喔，心不在焉的。”", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_mu3328", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大家如果在哪里看到像小熊喵一样的动物，要告诉我喔。”", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 330, "voice": "_mu3329", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总之，暂时观察一下情况吧。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来熊喵也有同伴……想想也是当然的。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_07.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然想让它们见面……", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
